{"id":"ob","lemma":"об","pos":"prep","rank":89,"glosses":["about"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/4/46/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B1_.ogg/Ru-%D0%BE%D0%B1_.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Ты знала об этом?","en":"Did you know about it?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,null]},{"text":"Вы об этом знаете?","en":"Do you know about that?","words":[{"g":"you (pl. / formal)"},null,null,{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"}]},{"text":"Ты можешь рассказать мне об этом?","en":"Can you tell me about it?","words":[{"g":"you"},{"g":"can, be able to","l":"мочь"},{"g":"to tell"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},null,null]},{"text":"Никто не хочет говорить об этом.","en":"Nobody wants to talk about that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/661152","words":[{"g":"nobody, no one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},{"g":"to speak, to talk"},null,null]},{"text":"Я сказал им об этом вчера.","en":"I told them about that yesterday.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1283170","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to say, to tell","l":"сказать"},{"g":"(to) them","l":"он"},null,null,{"g":"yesterday"}]}]}